### Home-page sections (SectionApi)
### The home page used to be a hard-coded list of four product groups in the storefront's loader; these rows
### replace it, so a seller can reorder the page and put things other than product rails on it.

### List
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Create a product-group rail
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "featured-rail",
  "kind": "PRODUCT_GROUP",
  "targetValue": "FEATURED_ITEMS",
  "itemLimit": 8,
  "layout": "carousel",
  "sortOrder": 0,
  "translations": [
    {"language": "en", "title": "Featured this week", "subtitle": "Hand-picked by our team"},
    {"language": "ar", "title": "مختارات هذا الأسبوع"}
  ]
}

### Create an image block
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "lookbook",
  "kind": "IMAGE",
  "mediaId": 1,
  "sortOrder": 1,
  "cta": {"kind": "PAGE", "value": "about-us"},
  "translations": [{"language": "en", "title": "The new season", "ctaLabel": "Read the story"}]
}

### Read one
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Update (send the version you read; a stale one is 409 CONTENT.VERSION.CONFLICT)
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "version": 1,
  "slug": "featured-rail",
  "kind": "PRODUCT_GROUP",
  "targetValue": "NEWLY_ADDED",
  "translations": [{"language": "en", "title": "Just arrived"}]
}

### Publish — a PRODUCT_GROUP section with no targetValue is 422 CONTENT.PUBLISH.INCOMPLETE
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/1/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{}

### Unpublish
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/1/unpublish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Reorder the whole page in one write; sections the body omits keep their relative order, after these
PATCH {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/reorder?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

[2, 1]

### Delete
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Tenant isolation — another store cannot read this store's section
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/sections/1?store={{OTHER_STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
